div.p:
Farewell my dear Sir present our remembrances to Mrs Wilberforce & your family,Barbara Wilberforce, née Spooner (1777–1847) and her children: William Wilberforce (1798–1879), later a
                 barrister and MP for Hull 1837–1838; Robert Wilberforce, later a clergyman and writer; Samuel Wilberforce (1805–1873;
                    DNB), later Bishop of Winchester 1870–1873; Henry Wilberforce (1807–1873; DNB), later a journalist;
                 and Elizabeth Wilberforce (1801–1832). & believe me
